@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tikosorted.com",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

### Saves the token from the login response so other requests can use it
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":  "Isukuti Fest ",
  "location": "Nairobi",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-20T18:00:00Z",
  "tiers": [
    { "type": "regular", "price": 1000, "total": 5 },
    { "type": "vip", "price": 3000, "total": 2 }
  ]
}